# loopback.list — vsock_test IDs for guest-to-self loopback
# (both --mode=server and --mode=client on the Windows guest;
#  control channel over 127.0.0.1, vsock peer-cid = own guest_cid).
#
# Row format: see forward.list.
# Contract: every enabled (id, variant) row MUST pass — failure is a regression.
# Rows are kept in numeric-ID order.
#
# Current baseline: vhi-8.1 HEAD 3ec8ad6a.  Loopback is intentionally
# the most conservative direction because most send()/recv() paths in
# Loopback.c currently hang on the Tx-ownership-transfer path; only
# rows known to survive that stay enabled here.

0    posix  SOCK_STREAM connection reset
0    wsa    SOCK_STREAM connection reset
0    overlapped SOCK_STREAM connection reset
1    posix  SOCK_STREAM bind only
1    wsa    SOCK_STREAM bind only
1    overlapped SOCK_STREAM bind only
2    posix  SOCK_STREAM client close
2    wsa    SOCK_STREAM client close
2    overlapped SOCK_STREAM client close
3    posix  SOCK_STREAM server close
3    wsa    SOCK_STREAM server close
3    overlapped SOCK_STREAM server close
4    posix  SOCK_STREAM multiple connections
4    wsa    SOCK_STREAM multiple connections
4    overlapped SOCK_STREAM multiple connections
5    posix  SOCK_STREAM MSG_PEEK
5    wsa    SOCK_STREAM MSG_PEEK
5    overlapped SOCK_STREAM MSG_PEEK
# 6  posix  SOCK_SEQPACKET msg bounds                       — disabled: SEQPACKET body needs recvmsg(MSG_EOR); missing from vsock_test.c — copy from upstream + driver SEQPACKET
# 7  posix  SOCK_SEQPACKET MSG_TRUNC flag                   — disabled: SEQPACKET body needs recvmsg; missing — copy from upstream + driver SEQPACKET
# 8  posix  SOCK_SEQPACKET timeout                          — disabled: SEQPACKET body missing from vsock_test.c — copy from upstream + driver SEQPACKET
# 9  posix  SOCK_SEQPACKET invalid receive buffer           — disabled: SEQPACKET body missing from vsock_test.c — copy from upstream + driver SEQPACKET
10   posix  SOCK_STREAM poll() + SO_RCVLOWAT
10   wsa    SOCK_STREAM poll() + SO_RCVLOWAT
10   overlapped SOCK_STREAM poll() + SO_RCVLOWAT
# 11 posix  SOCK_SEQPACKET big message                      — disabled: SEQPACKET body missing from vsock_test.c — copy from upstream + driver SEQPACKET
12   posix  SOCK_STREAM test invalid buffer
